@startuml uml_state_machine_assessment
title Clinical Assessment Lifecycle State Machine

[*] --> Draft : Patient initiates intake wizard

Draft --> Draft : Autosave step progress in session
Draft --> Validating : Patient clicks "Analyze Cardiovascular Profile"

Validating --> Draft : Range or enum validation error (HTTP 422)
Validating --> Processing : Valid 13-biomarker vector confirmed

state Processing {
    [*] --> ScalingFeatures
    ScalingFeatures --> CalculatingCAD : StandardScaler applied
    CalculatingCAD --> CalculatingASCVD : Calibrated XGBoost inference
    CalculatingASCVD --> ComputingSHAP : ACC/AHA equations
    ComputingSHAP --> InvarianceCheck : TreeSHAP C++ traversal
    InvarianceCheck --> CompletedState : Additivity error <= 10^-5
}

Processing --> Completed : DB transaction committed

state Completed {
    [*] --> Unreviewed
    Unreviewed --> GrantedToDoctor : Patient creates time-bounded grant
    GrantedToDoctor --> UnderClinicianReview : Doctor accesses chart
    UnderClinicianReview --> Reviewed : Doctor appends countersigned note
}

Completed --> CounterfactualSimulating : Patient runs what-if sliders
CounterfactualSimulating --> Completed : Target saved or dismissed

Completed --> Exported : 1-page clinical visit briefing generated
Reviewed --> Exported : Final consultation summary downloaded

Completed --> Purged : Patient exercises GDPR Right to Erasure
Reviewed --> Purged : Patient exercises GDPR Right to Erasure

Purged --> [*]

@enduml
